sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Dashboard
    participant API as POST /api/websites/{id}/crawl
    participant BG as Background Task (run_crawl)
    participant Frontier as CrawlFrontier (Postgres queue)
    participant Web as Target Website
    participant DB as Postgres

    U->>FE: Add website URL + start crawl
    FE->>API: create Website + POST /crawl
    API->>DB: CrawlJob(status=queued), Website.status=crawling
    API->>BG: background task run_crawl(job_id)
    API-->>FE: 202 Accepted (poll /jobs for progress)

    BG->>Web: fetch robots.txt + sitemap
    BG->>Frontier: enqueue seed URLs (idempotent)
    loop up to 6 parallel workers
        BG->>Frontier: claim_batch() FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        BG->>Web: fetch page (SSRF-safe, 5MB cap)
        BG->>BG: checksum check — skip if unchanged
        BG->>BG: extract text -> chunk -> embed
        BG->>DB: insert WebsitePage + DocumentChunk rows
    end
    BG->>DB: CrawlJob.status=done, Website.status=ready
